    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251930/extras/39da1227d2c47a23a1a3b369159c7449.poster.avif?t=1748947425\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251930/extras/39da1227d2c47a23a1a3b369159c7449.webm?t=1748947425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251930/extras/39da1227d2c47a23a1a3b369159c7449.mp4?t=1748947425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHILLS TO THE BONE! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months ago, a catastrophic explosion at the Beacon plunged the world into an endless winter. People continue to perish, and the only hope of restoring order lies in repairing the Beacon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Victor</strong>, an engineer on a mission to save humanity, you\u2019ll journey through a frozen city, scavenging materials for the Beacon and encountering survivors \u2013 some bloodthirsty, some benign. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level-based Structure!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 immersive levels split between two distinct locations: outdoor levels focused on parkour and indoor areas centered on fight. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous Cutscenes and Dialogues!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Victor\u2019s dramatic journey through powerful scenes and dialogues that reveal a rich story and universe filled with vibrant characters. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Jump and Maneuver!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer controls at their best! Each area is packed with obstacles and deadly foes, keeping you on your toes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss victory, requiring refined combat skills, unlocks new abilities, making each step of your adventure even more thrilling. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU READY? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring <strong>hope</strong> back to a world on the brink of <strong>collapse</strong>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHILLS TO THE BONE! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months ago, a catastrophic explosion at the Beacon plunged the world into an endless winter. People continue to perish, and the only hope of restoring order lies in repairing the Beacon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Victor</strong>, an engineer on a mission to save humanity, you\u2019ll journey through a frozen city, scavenging materials for the Beacon and encountering survivors \u2013 some bloodthirsty, some benign. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level-based Structure!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 immersive levels split between two distinct locations: outdoor levels focused on parkour and indoor areas centered on fight. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous Cutscenes and Dialogues!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Victor\u2019s dramatic journey through powerful scenes and dialogues that reveal a rich story and universe filled with vibrant characters. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Jump and Maneuver!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer controls at their best! Each area is packed with obstacles and deadly foes, keeping you on your toes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss victory, requiring refined combat skills, unlocks new abilities, making each step of your adventure even more thrilling. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU READY? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring <strong>hope</strong> back to a world on the brink of <strong>collapse</strong>?</p>",
